chapter.v:
	Now when 

	 Phinehas the son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the priest, saw it, he rose from among the congregation and took a javelin in his hand;
 [Ps. 106:30 m Ex.]

	Therefore say, 

	 ‘Behold, I give to him My covenant of peace;
 [[Mal. 2:4, 5; 3:1] t Is. 54:10; Ezek. 34:25; 37:26; Mal. 2:5]
